  "pg066_im006": {
    "visible": "Zoezi la 6: Soma namba zifuatazo kwa sauti. Jedwali la namba lenye mistari mitano: mstari wa kwanza 12, 99, 54, 20, 34, 78, 23, 67, 98, 30; mstari wa pili 88, 26, 13, 22, 50, 75, 68, 99, 57, 85; mstari wa tatu 90, 51, 44, 25, 80, 28, 40, 48, 33, 77; mstari wa nne 34, 23, 60, 76, 89, 65, 29, 35, 84, 91; mstari wa tano 99, 45, 95, 88, 15, 70, 46, 55, 67, 100.",
    "spoken": [
      "Zoezi la sita: Soma namba zifuatazo kwa sauti. Jedwali la namba lenye mistari mitano: mstari wa kwanza kumi na mbili, tisini na tisa, hamsini na nne, ishirini, thelathini na nne, sabini na nane, ishirini na tatu, sitini na saba, tisini na nane, thelathini; mstari wa pili themanini na nane, ishirini na sita, kumi na tatu, ishirini na mbili, hamsini, sabini na tano, sitini na nane, tisini na tisa, hamsini na saba, themanini na tano; mstari wa tatu tisini, hamsini na moja, arobaini na nne, ishirini na tano, themanini, ishirini na nane, arobaini, arobaini na nane, thelathini na tatu, sabini na saba; mstari wa nne thelathini na nne, ishirini na tatu, sitini, sabini na sita, themanini na tisa, sitini na tano, ishirini na tisa, thelathini na tano, themanini na nne, tisini na moja; mstari wa tano tisini na tisa, arobaini na tano, tisini na tano, themanini na nane, kumi na tano, sabini, arobaini na sita, hamsini na tano, sitini na saba, mia moja."
    ],
    "voices": [
      "sw-TZ-DaudiNeural"
    ]
  },
